      "caption": "",
      "description": "Annual wildfire burned area in the United States between the years 1983 and 2025. The data comes from the National Interagency Fire Center. The extent of area burned by wildfires each year appears to have increased since the 1980s. According to National Interagency Fire Center data, of the 10 years with the largest acreage burned, all have occurred since 2004, including the peak years in 2015 and 2020.",
